  "html": "\r\n<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN\" >\r\n<HTML>\r\n  <!--%@ OutputCache Duration=60 VaryByParam=\"flora_id;taxon_id\"  %-->\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<!-- Google Tag Manager -->\r\n<script>(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\r\nnew Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\r\nj=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\r\n'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\r\n})(window,document,'script','dataLayer','GTM-TGK4SMV');</script>\r\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager -->\r\n<title>Haplophyllum in Flora of Pakistan @ efloras.org</title>\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href='/templates/eflora.css' />\r\n<script src=\"JavaScript/eflora.js\" type=\"text/javascript\" ></script>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n\r\n  <!-- body onload=\"formMOMap.submit()\" -->\r\n  <body>\r\n\r\n    <TABLE id=\"TableMain\" cellSpacing=\"1\" cellPadding=\"1\" width=\"640\" border=\"0\">\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD><!--%@ Register TagPrefix=\"ucFlora\" TagName=\"TaxonSearchBox\" Src=\"TaxonSearchBox.ascx\" %-->\r\n\r\n<script language=\"javascript\">\r\n\r\nfunction jsClearTextBox(sender)\r\n{\r\n  // alert(formSearchBox[\"name_str\"].id);\r\n  // alert(sender.value);\r\n  if (sender.value == \"taxon name\")\r\n  {\r\n    sender.value = \"\";\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n</script>\r\n<table id=\"ucEfloraHeader_tableHeaderWrapper\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<TD style=\"WIDTH: 479px\"><a id=\"ucEfloraHeader_linkFloraHome\" title=\"Flora Homepage\" href=\"flora_page.aspx?flora_id=5\"><img src=\"images/flora/eflora-logo-5.gif\" id=\"ucEfloraHeader_imageLogo\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Link to Flora of Pakistan home\" /><br>\r\n        </a></TD>\r\n\t\t<TD valign=\"bottom\" align=\"right\">\r\n      <div id=\"ucEfloraHeader_panelSearchBox\">\r\n\t\t\t <!-- begin of search box -->\r\n        <FORM name=\"formSearchBox\" action=\"browse.aspx\" method=\"get\">\r\n          <TABLE borderColor=\"#ccffcc\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"2\" width=\"200\" border=\"1\">\r\n            <TR>\r\n              <TD>\r\n                <span id=\"ucEfloraHeader_lblSearchBox\"><INPUT TYPE='Hidden' NAME='flora_id' ' id='flora_id' VALUE='5' >\n&nbsp;<input id=name_str name=name_str &nbsp;  value=''  class=small title='Use % as the wildcard\r\n(e.g. pinus % or pinus a%)'  onfocus='jsClearTextBox(this);' accessKey=s size=15> <input class=small type=submit value=Search name=btnSearch><br>\n <input name=chkAllFloras type=checkbox   > <span class=small>All Floras &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<A HREF='search_page.aspx?flora_id=5'  TARGET='_top'  class='a.link.small'>Advanced Search</A></span>\n</span></TD>\r\n            </TR>\r\n          </TABLE>\r\n        </FORM> <!-- end of search box -->\r\n      \r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    </TD>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdSubHeader\">\r\n<table id=\"FooterTableOut\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <TD>\r\n      <table bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" id=\"footerTable\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"WIDTH: 291px\"> Page 2</td>\r\n          <TD align=\"right\">\r\n            <span id=\"ucEfloraSubHeader_lblLinks\"><a target='_top' href='/login.aspx'>Login</a>\n | <A HREF='/index.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >eFloras Home</A> | <A HREF='/help_page.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >Help</A></span></TD>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </TD>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdBody\">\r\n          <table id=\"tableBody\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <td id=\"tdLeftBar\" valign=\"top\" width=\"0\"></td>\r\n\r\n              <td id=\"tdContent\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"1930\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td vAlign=\"top\">\r\n                      <table id=\"tableTaxonChain\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<td><span id=\"lblTaxonChain\"><font size=\"2\"><A HREF='flora_page.aspx?flora_id=5'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='Flora homepage' >Pakistan</A> | <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=5'  TARGET='_top' >Family List</A> | <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=10781'  TARGET='_top' >Rutaceae</A> <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=5&start_taxon_id=10781'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='lower taxa' ><img border='0' src='images/layout/icon-list.gif'></A></font></span></td>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <div id=\"panelTaxonTreatment\">\r\n\t\r\n                        <span id=\"lblTaxonDesc\"><!-- Default Template -->\r\n<b>Haplophyllum</b> Juss. in Mem. Mus. Hist. Nat.  12:464. tab. 17. No. 10.  1825.  Boiss., Fl. Or. 1:922.1867; Vvedenskii in Schischkin, Fl. URSS. 14:200-227. 1949; Rech. f., Flora of Lowland Iraq (1964); Townsend in Kew Bull. 20:89-102. 1966; id. in Davis, Fl. Turk. 2:496.1967; id. in Rech. f., Fl. Iran. 36:2.1966. id. in Tutin et al., Fl. Eur. 2:227.1968.  \r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nPerennial herbs and semishrubs, branching profusely and often woody below, glandular punctate and strongly aromatic. Leaves simple, alternate, mostly lanceolate to elliptic or linear or 3(-5)-sect. Inflorescence in corymbose cymes, bracteate. Sepals 5. Petals 5, concave. Stamens 10, filaments free, subulate and pubescent/barbate on the inner side. Ovary 3-5-locular; locules 1-6 (-10)-ovulate; styles fused; stigma capitate. Capsule 3-5-lobed, usually dehiscent. Seeds reniform, rugose.<p>\r\n\r\nA large genus comprising 70 species distributed from the Mediterranean region to E. Siberia. 7 species are found in Pakistan. All parts of the plant contain aromatic essential oils.<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<P>\r\n</span>\r\n                        <P><!-- Key -->\r\n                        <div id=\"panelKey\">\r\n\t\t\r\n                          <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                          <table id=\"tableKey\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#d5ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD width=\"347\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyTitle\"><b><font size=\"2\"></font></b></span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD nowrap=\"nowrap\" align=\"right\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyEditLink\"><font size=\"1\"></font></span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#f1ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD colspan=\"2\">\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKeyDesc\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></P>\r\n                                <P>\r\n                                  <span id=\"lblKey\"><TABLE  WIDTH='100%' BORDER='0' >\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-1'>1</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Ovary and capsule 3(-4)-locular</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071485'  TARGET='_top' >Haplophyllum gilesii</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Ovary and capsule 5-locular</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-2'>(2)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-2'>2</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-1'>(1)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Petals 6.5-9 mm long, red to reddish-yellow. Ovary segments with tuberculate apical appendages</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-3'>(3)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Petals 4-5 mm long, yellow. Ovary segments without apical appendages</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-5'>(5)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-3'>3</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-2'>(2)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Stem, leaves and sepals glabrous. Each locule 2-4-ovulate</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-4'>(4)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Stems patent white villous; leaves white hairy. Sepals densely white ciliate. Each locule 5-10-ovulate</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071496'  TARGET='_top' >Haplophyllum pedicellatum</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-4'>4</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-3'>(3)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Leaves somewhat fleshy, margin crenulate. Petals\r\nglabrous. Each locule 2-ovulate</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071499'  TARGET='_top' >Haplophyllum crenulatum</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Leaves not fleshy, entire. Petals pulverulent. Each\r\nlocule 4-ovulate</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071487'  TARGET='_top' >Haplophyllum erythraeum</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-5'>5</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-2'>(2)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Each locule 2-ovulate. Capsule dehiscent Leaves linear-oblong to lanceolate or obovate or trisect</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP><A HREF='#KEY-1-6'>(6)</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Each locule 1-ovulate. Capsule indehiscent. Leaves mostly elliptic to oblong-elliptic</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071494'  TARGET='_top' >Haplophyllum acutifolium</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP><A NAME='KEY-1-6'>6</A> <A HREF='#KEY-1-5'>(5)</A></td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Capsule glandular-punctate, shortly pubescent in the lower portion. Sepals persistent. Intermediate leaves trisect</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071482'  TARGET='_top' >Haplophyllum dubium</A></td>\n</TR>\n<TR >\n  <td WIDTH=50 NOWRAP VALIGN=TOP>+</td>\n  <td WIDTH=400 VALIGN=TOP>Capsule with protuding convex glands, white-woolly (sometimes glabrous). Sepals deciduous. (only some leaves trisect.)</td>\n  <td >&nbsp;</td>\n  <td VALIGN=TOP NOWRAP> <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=220006049'  TARGET='_top' >Haplophyllum tuberculatum</A></td>\n</TR>\n</TABLE>\n</span></P>\r\n                              </TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#d5ffff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<TD colspan=\"2\">\r\n                                <span id=\"lblKeyList\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></TD>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t</table>\r\n\t\t\r\n                        \r\n\t</div></P> \r\n                        <P>\r\n                          <span id=\"lblLowerTaxonList\"><p>\n<B>Lower Taxa</B><br>\n<ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071494' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>acutifolium</b>  (DC.) G. Don</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071499' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>crenulatum</b>  Boiss.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071482' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>dubium</b>  Korov.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071487' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>erythraeum</b>  Boiss.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071485' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>gilesii</b>  (Hemsl.) C.C. Townsend</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071496' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>pedicellatum</b>  Bunge ex Boiss.</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=220006049' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>tuberculatum</b>  (Forssk.) Juss.</A></ul>\n<p>\n<p>\n<B>Related Synonym(s):</B><br>\n<ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071484' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Haplophyllum</i> <i>albrti-regelli</i> f. <i>sub-ternata</i>  Korov. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071482' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>dubium</b>  Korov.</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071491' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Haplophyllum</i> <i>glabrum</i>  (DC) G. Don = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=220006049' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>tuberculatum</b>  (Forssk.) Juss.</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=200012456' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Haplophyllum</i> <i>perforatum</i>  Kar. & Kir. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071494' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>acutifolium</b>  (DC.) G. Don</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071495' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Haplophyllum</i> <i>perforatum*</i>  (M.B.) Vved. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071494' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>acutifolium</b>  (DC.) G. Don</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071492' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Haplophyllum</i> <i>stocksianum</i>  Boiss. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=220006049' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>tuberculatum</b>  (Forssk.) Juss.</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071483' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Haplophyllum</i> <i>superpositum</i>  Kitam. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071482' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>dubium</b>  Korov.</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071493' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Haplophyllum</i> <i>villosulum</i>  Boiss. & Hausskn. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=220006049' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>tuberculatum</b>  (Forssk.) Juss.</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=242345834' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Ruta</i> <i>acutifolia</i>  DC. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071494' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>acutifolium</b>  (DC.) G. Don</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071500' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Ruta</i> <i>crenulata</i>  (Boiss.) Burkill = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071499' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>crenulatum</b>  Boiss.</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071488' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Ruta</i> <i>erythraea</i>  (Boiss.) Aitch. & Hemsl. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071487' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>erythraeum</b>  Boiss.</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071486' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Ruta</i> <i>gilesii</i>  Hemsl. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071485' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>gilesii</b>  (Hemsl.) C.C. Townsend</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071498' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Ruta</i> <i>hirustum</i>  (Regel & Schmahl.) Kuntze = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071496' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>pedicellatum</b>  Bunge ex Boiss.</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071497' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Ruta</i> <i>pedicellata</i>  (Bunge ex Boiss.) Aitch. & Hems!. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071496' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>pedicellatum</b>  Bunge ex Boiss.</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=242345836' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Ruta</i> <i>perforata</i>  M.B. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071494' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>acutifolium</b>  (DC.) G. Don</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=220011808' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Ruta</i> <i>tuberculata</i>  Forssk. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=220006049' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>tuberculatum</b>  (Forssk.) Juss.</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071489' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Ruta</i> <i>tuberculata</i> var. <i>forskahlii</i>  DC. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=220006049' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>tuberculatum</b>  (Forssk.) Juss.</A></A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=250071490' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Ruta</i> <i>tuberculata</i> var. <i>montbretti</i>  DC. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=220006049' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Haplophyllum</b> <b>tuberculatum</b>  (Forssk.) Juss.</A></A></ul>\n<p>\n</span></P>\r\n                        <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                        <P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n                        <table id=\"tableObjectList\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpaddin